        "number": 1,
        "text": "It is morning. Lily and Tom are in the kitchen. Mom has fruit. There is an apple. There is a mango. There is an orange. There is a banana."
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "text": "\"A banana, please,\" says Lily. \"Here you are,\" says Mom. \"Thank you, Mom!\" Lily eats the banana. \"Milk, please,\" says Tom. \"Here you are,\" says Mom. Tom drinks the milk. Mom drinks orange juice."
      },
      {
        "number": 3,
        "text": "Pip looks at an egg. \"Woof!\" says Pip. \"An egg, Pip?\" asks Mom. \"No, Pip!\" \"The egg is for Tom.\" \"Here is water, Pip.\" Pip drinks the water. Pip is happy. Good dog, Pip!"
      }
